### Directwerk — Newsletter lists (EMAIL_NOTIFY)
### Prerequisites: 02-oauth2.http (tenantAAccessToken), 24-articles.http (articleId optional for attach).

### @name listNewsletterLists
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/newsletter-lists
Host: {{tenantAHost}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantAAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### @name createNewsletterList
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/newsletter-lists
Host: {{tenantAHost}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantAAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "slug": "weekly",
  "name": "Weekly",
  "description": "Weekly digest"
}

###

### @name publicNewsletterCatalog
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/public/newsletter-lists
Host: {{tenantAHost}}
Accept: application/json

###

### @name publicNewsletterListBySlug
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/public/newsletter-lists/weekly
Host: {{tenantAHost}}
Accept: application/json

###

### @name publicNewsletterSubscribe
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/public/newsletter-lists/weekly/subscribe
Host: {{tenantAHost}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "reader@example.com"
}

###

### @name attachNewsletterListsToArticle
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/articles/{{articleId}}/newsletter-lists
Host: {{tenantAHost}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantAAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "newsletterListIds": [1]
}

###

### @name confirmNewsletterSubscription
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/public/newsletter/confirm
Host: {{tenantAHost}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "token": "replace-from-mailpit"
}

###

### @name unsubscribeNewsletter
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/public/newsletter/unsubscribe
Host: {{tenantAHost}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "token": "replace-from-mailpit"
}
